essages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":5,"newStart":12,"newLines":7,"lines":[" messages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs"," `COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`)."," Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system","-prompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up","-messages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.","+prompt is two blocks, each with a `cache_control` marker. The static coaching","+instructions come first, then the per-athlete context (date, profile, zones,","+facts). A `save_fact` write only invalidates the second block, so the","+instructions stay cached."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UHWyS6i6owDLMFAqZCQy4B","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
